title: Play fullscreen
intro: Play the game over the whole screen, as a player sees it, and come back to the editor without stopping it.
project: Platformer | Fullscreen

chapter: The whole screen | Game > Play Fullscreen, or Alt+Enter
play
say: Play runs the game in the Game tab, beside the editor's panels.
hold: Right 1
say: Alt Enter, or Play Fullscreen in the Game menu, moves the running game over the whole screen the editor is on, with no border.
key: Alt+Enter
expectfullscreen: true
hold: Right 1.5
tap: Space
say: It's the same game, still running. Its camera, its HUD and the mouse all work at the screen's size, as they will on a player's screen.

chapter: The editor's keys still work | Pause, rewind, back to the editor
pause
expectfullscreen: true
say: F6 pauses it, and it stays fullscreen. Paused, the timeline shows above the game, to rewind it.
rewind: 0.4
say: The game went back a moment.
pause
hold: Left 1
key: Alt+Enter
expectfullscreen: false
say: Alt Enter again brings the game back to the Game tab, still playing. A breakpoint, an error that pauses the game, or Stop bring it back too.
stop
expectfullscreen: false
